Package: metawoRld
Title: A Framework for Managing Data in Living Systematic Reviews
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Anders Hagen", "Jarmund", , "anders.h.jarmund@ntnu.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3923-1637"))
Description: Provides a structured environment for creating, validating and
    managing data for living systematic reviews. Study metadata and results are
    stored as YAML and CSV files that are validated against project-specific
    forms. Every input channel (an entry form, CSV files, the 'DataFindR'
    package for AI-assisted extraction, scripts) submits through one validated
    intake; accepted data carry provenance, human verification and file
    hashes (Frictionless Data Packages). Includes a search and screening log
    with PRISMA counts, dual extraction with reconciliation, meta-analyses and
    a Quarto dashboard.
